# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of each
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows
# checkouts (autocrlf=true) convert files to CRLF on disk, which then
# makes Prettier's format:check falsely report every touched file as
# "needs reformatting" - the actual committed content is fine (LF,
# confirmed via CI, which runs on Linux and never sees this), it's a
# local checkout artifact only. See docs/PROJECT_PLAN.md §7.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files - never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
